WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.470
After approval arrives, check the current level and whether the local owner can now continue.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:10.430
Choose De-escalate and state what changed, such as approval of the replacement part.

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:16.320
Confirm the lower level and inspect History; lowering the escalation does not resolve the equipment fault.
